WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.013
I came out in high school.

00:00:01.014 --> 00:00:05.012
And a lot of my extended family kind of cast me out in a way.

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:08.013
I wasn’t really spoken to much after that.

00:00:08.014 --> 00:00:12.020
When I first came out I was told that I was too feminine to be a man.

00:00:12.021 --> 00:00:15.014
And that made me feel pretty powerless.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:19.008
Unfortunately I felt that my sexuality was a secret.

00:00:19.009 --> 00:00:24.007
Something that was keeping me from love, keeping me from being fully accepted.

00:00:24.008 --> 00:00:29.016
When you’re young and you’re dealing with your identity, it’s confusing and tough,

00:00:29.017 --> 00:00:33.012
and the way I found my way out of that was by telling people.

00:00:34.014 --> 00:00:36.002
When people take away our power,

00:00:36.003 --> 00:00:38.011
it’s because they’re afraid of things that are different,

00:00:38.012 --> 00:00:40.022
or challenge their systems of belief.

00:00:40.023 --> 00:00:44.003
Just because I have to follow somebody else’s arbitrary rules, 

00:00:44.004 --> 00:00:47.014
doesn’t mean I am less than; doesn’t mean I don’t have a voice.

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:49.008
I just have to get creative.

00:00:49.009 --> 00:00:50.020
My power is my authenticity.

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:54.021
What makes me feel the most powerful now

00:00:54.022 --> 00:00:58.008
is choosing to give up fear.

00:00:58.009 --> 00:01:00.016
My power is perseverance.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:06.012
I will not apologize for being myself.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.022
You can literally just sit there being queer

00:01:10.023 --> 00:01:14.009
and you’re already doing more than most people in this world.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.004
I mean, you’re incredible.

00:01:17.004 --> 00:01:18.012
You don’t have to feel scared.

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:21.021
Know that every feeling is impermanent.

00:01:21.022 --> 00:01:23.018
This feeling will pass, it is not forever.

00:01:23.019 --> 00:01:26.019
I have felt powerless. Everyone feels powerless at some point.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:29.008
And honey we just got to keep going.

00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:31.001
You can’t take my power.

00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:36.015
It’s being understood; it’s being heard;

00:01:36.016 --> 00:01:39.013
it’s being there for one another no matter what.

00:01:39.014 --> 00:01:42.022
Every day is reclaiming that power.

00:01:42.023 --> 00:01:46.017
My power is self love.

00:01:46.018 --> 00:01:49.005
I think love is the most strong and powerful feeling,

00:01:49.006 --> 00:01:52.007
and I think the LGBTQ+ Community has got that locked down.

00:01:54.018 --> 00:01:58.000
In solidarity there is power.

00:01:58.001 --> 00:02:00.013
Find a community around you who can remind you

00:02:00.014 --> 00:02:02.019
of why you are so beautifully queer.

00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:14.010
This is our power.

00:02:14.011 --> 00:02:16.017
This, this is our power.

